# Dependencies permitted to run install lifecycle scripts.
#
# Format: <package-name>  # reason
#
# The gate blocks a commit that adds a dependency without a recorded
# decision here. A package listed below has been reviewed: its install
# scripts either do not exist or do not run untrusted code at install time.

commander  # no install/postinstall scripts; ships a prebuilt ESM bundle
ignore  # no install/postinstall scripts; pure JavaScript, build is a dev step
typescript  # no install/postinstall scripts; the compiler is a plain binary
vitest  # no install/postinstall scripts; test runner only, never shipped
@types/node  # type declarations only; no runtime code and no install scripts
